   "x": 284,
   "y": 226,
   "width": 290,
   "height": 195,
   "text": "description:\n  does: multi-workstream hardening\n  triggers:\n    \"harden the cluster\"\n    \"triage the benchmark findings\"\n    \"check blast radius\"\n    \"fix the policy violations\"\n  do-not-use:\n    greenfield cluster setup\n    production deployment · secret CRUD\n    admission policies from scratch\n    role development · CI/CD config",
