   "y": 1092,
   "width": 370,
   "height": 222,
   "text": "02 progressive disclosure: refs load per phase\n03 description-as-router: no sibling named\n05 provenance + drift: snapshot as standing truth\n06 degrees of freedom: prose · scripts + JSON\n07 capability taxonomy: 2 subagents, smaller model\n16 permission ladder: by tier, all prose\n17 blast-radius gating: secrets store always asks\n19 scope lock + checkpoints: 3 named, backlog",
